WEBVTT

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:00.000
Ooo.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.260
Poți să mergi?

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:04.390
Bebe: Da.

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:09.990
DR: Mami, merge!

00:19:09.990 --> 00:19:11.000
(Râsete)

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.940
(Aplauze)

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:15.950
DR: Vă mulțumesc.

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:30.000
(Aplauze)